'RectangleCLT.Companion.SplitV4.fourthMomentOptimal' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
Audited 73 fourth-moment lower theorem declarations, each transitively; only the permitted three axioms.
Theorem 5 uses the genuine unmasked theta^(-1/4) amplitude model. Actual envelope fourth moments, coordinate fourth moments, iid symmetry, Gaussian covariance matching, orthant limit 1/(2sqrt(2)e), full-distance lower limit and both fixed-envelope supremum consequences are proved. No comparison estimate or calibration limit is assumed in the terminal theorem.
